; JPY has a stored precision of 0 after the 1000 JPY posting, yet the
; amount inferred from the 3 Z @ 100.4 JPY cost still shows the cost's
; precision (#1692).  That widening reads the commodity's stored precision,
; whether or not a later change records that the 0 was learned (#3278), so
; the inferred -301.2 JPY is not shown as -301 JPY.

2018-05-01 * Opening
    Assets:Yen                1000 JPY
    Equity:Opening

2018-05-02 * Quux
    Assets:I                    3 Z @ 100.4 JPY
    Assets:J

test bal Assets:I Assets:J
          -301.2 JPY
                 3 Z  Assets
                 3 Z    I
          -301.2 JPY    J
--------------------
          -301.2 JPY
                 3 Z
end test

test reg Assets:J
18-May-02 Quux                  Assets:J                 -301.2 JPY   -301.2 JPY
end test
